text.en:
Four arms cover the table; let `when others` catch the `"11"` (OR) case, and outside the process drive `y <= std_logic_vector(r);`.
```vhdl
case op is
    when "00"   => r <= unsigned(a) + unsigned(b);
    when "01"   => r <= unsigned(a) - unsigned(b);
    when "10"   => r <= unsigned(a) and unsigned(b);
    when others => r <= unsigned(a) or  unsigned(b);
end case;
```

